  "help": "<p>This tool converts common rectangular R objects stored in <cite>.rds</cite>, <cite>.rdata</cite>, or\n<cite>.rda</cite> files into Galaxy tabular datasets. Auto-detection uses known filename\nextensions when available and falls back to trying both RDS and RData readers\nfor extensionless Galaxy dataset paths.</p>\n<p>Use this for analysis results saved as a single R object, for example a\ndifferential-expression result table. It is intentionally different from older\n<cite>.RData</cite> extraction tools that call <cite>load()</cite> and cannot read <cite>.rds</cite> files.</p>\n",
